//    - Init: copied from preconditions (insideConstrained ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrained)).
//    - OpenConstrainedSpan: sets currentConstrainedOut := [], parser.IsValidPrefix([]) holds by
//      precondition, insideConstrainedOut := true. Invariant maintained.
//    - Forced-token loop: each AppendConstrainedToken is guarded by IsTokenValidNext check
//      (valid == true), which ensures parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut + [tok]).
//      After appending, the new currentConstrainedOut satisfies IsValidPrefix. Maintained.
//    - AdaptiveConstrainedStep loop: hard mask ensures returned token is parser-valid.
//      AppendConstrainedToken preserves IsValidPrefix. CloseConstrainedSpan sets
//      insideConstrainedOut := false making implication vacuous. Maintained.
//    - CloseSpanIfComplete: if closed, insideConstrainedOut := false (vacuous). If not, no-op. Maintained.
//
// 2. progress: |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
//    - Init: steps=0, |generated|=|generatedPrefix|. 0 <= 0. OK.
//    - OpenConstrainedSpan: steps += 1, |generated| += 1 (the "<<"). OK.
//    - Forced-token loop: each iteration steps += 1 (AdaptiveConstrainedStep or skipped),
