//    - Init: copied from precondition.
//    - OpenConstrainedSpan: sets currentConstrainedOut := [], which satisfies
//      parser.IsValidPrefix([]) by the method precondition. insideConstrainedOut := true. OK.
//    - AdaptiveConstrainedStep + AppendConstrainedToken: AdaptiveConstrainedStep hard-masks to
//      parser-valid next tokens, so the returned token is valid. AppendConstrainedToken
//      maintains IsValidPrefix by its postcondition. OK.
//    - CloseSpanIfComplete (closed=true): insideConstrainedOut := false, making implication vacuous.
//      currentConstrainedOut := []. OK.
//    - CloseSpanIfComplete (closed=false): no state change. OK.
//    - RollbackConstrainedToComplete: postcondition guarantees IsValidPrefix of result. OK.
//    - CloseConstrainedSpan: insideConstrainedOut := false, making implication vacuous. OK.
//    - EOS break: state unchanged. OK.
//
// 2. progress: |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
//    - Init: steps=0, |generated|=|generatedPrefix|. 0 <= 0. OK.
//    - OpenConstrainedSpan: steps += 1, appends "<<" to generated (+1 token). 
//      |generated| = |generatedPrefix| + 1 = |generatedPrefix| + steps. OK.
//    - Main loop: each iteration always increments steps by at least 1.
//      - AdaptiveConstrainedStep: steps += 1, AppendConstrainedToken adds 1 token to generated.
//        So both steps and |generated| - |generatedPrefix| increase by 1. OK.
//      - CloseSpanIfComplete: steps += 1, adds at most 1 token (">>" when closing). OK.
//      - RollbackConstrainedToComplete: steps += 0 (no cost), |generated| may decrease or
//        stay same. OK (decreasing generated preserves upper bound).
//      - CloseConstrainedSpan: steps += 1, adds ">>" or nothing. OK.
