//    `requires parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrained + [next])` - this is stronger
//    than IsTokenValidNext. And line 475: `requires next in lm.Tokens`.
//    The verifier can't prove `tok in lm.Tokens` from `valid == true` alone because
//    IsTokenValidNext doesn't have that postcondition guaranteed to Dafny.
//    
//    FIX: Instead of forcing tokens manually (which requires proving membership in
//    lm.Tokens), use only the safe generation helpers that guarantee this internally.
//    Use ConstrainedStep (which returns tokens from lm.Tokens or eosToken) and
//    AppendConstrainedToken together. Drop the manual forced-token approach.
//    
//    Use AdaptiveConstrainedStep for all constrained generation. The LM with good
//    guidance should produce O=C=N... naturally. We rely on AppendTaskGuidance.
//    
//    Structure:
//    - AppendTaskGuidance with strong isocyanate instructions
//    - OpenConstrainedSpan
//    - Loop: AdaptiveConstrainedStep + AppendConstrainedToken or EOS/close
//    
//    For progress: each loop iteration increments steps by 1 (from the step helper)
//    plus possibly 1 more from CloseConstrainedSpan.
